graph TD
  Q[(queue.json<br/>eligible posting)]:::out --> EXT[Chrome extension<br/>reads the real form]

  LEDGER[(ledger.json<br/>facts a person verified)]:::human --> EXT
  BANK[(answers.json<br/>written offline)]:::human --> EXT

  EXT --> FIELD{field type?}

  FIELD -->|free text| MATCH[matching.core.js<br/>which answer fits?]:::core
  MATCH -->|no entry| REFUSE
  MATCH -->|found| VAL{validator.core.js<br/>every number and proper noun<br/>traceable to a fact?}:::core
  VAL -->|untraceable| REFUSE

  FIELD -->|dropdown| SEL{selects.js<br/>resolves from a<br/>declared profile field?}:::core
  SEL -->|no rule or unset| REFUSE
  SEL -->|custom widget| REFUSE

  FIELD -->|file upload| MANUAL[always manual<br/>browsers forbid it]:::safe

  VAL -->|traceable| FILL[fill the field]
  SEL -->|resolved| FILL

  REFUSE[REFUSE<br/>required field: abandon<br/>optional: leave blank]:::refuse
  REFUSE --> REPORT[report what and why]:::safe

  FILL --> DRY{dry run?}
  DRY -->|DEFAULT| STOP[fill and stop<br/>nothing submitted]:::safe
  DRY -->|explicit opt-in| SUBMIT[submit under your name]:::danger

  classDef core fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e8783f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef human fill:#e6f7f1,stroke:#4fc3a1,stroke-width:2px
  classDef refuse fill:#fdecea,stroke:#d33,stroke-width:2px
  classDef safe fill:#e6f7f1,stroke:#4fc3a1
  classDef danger fill:#fdecea,stroke:#b00020,stroke-width:2px
  classDef out fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e8783f
